<p>	  LESLIE  8/1/97   USDA 1996   USDA 1995</p>
<p> N CAROLINA   34,560	34,800	26,750</p>
<p> S CAROLINA   17,080	13,500	12,720</p>
<p> GEORGIA	12,600	10,140	 8,370</p>
<p> KENTUCKY     43,520	44,840	41,400</p>
<p> TENNESSEE    41,910	40,250	34,560</p>
<p> ALABAMA	 9,880	10,710	 5,400</p>
<p> MISS	   57,400	54,250	37,800</p>
<p> ARKANSAS    102,950     112,000	88,400</p>
